  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おちゃの　ふりをして　まちがえてのんでしまった　あいての　せいきをすいとろうとするが　ばれがちだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "차로 위장하여 실수로 마셔 버린 상대의 생기를 흡수하려 하나 금방 들통나 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然會假裝成茶企圖吸取誤飲者的精氣，但經常會被識破。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se fait passer pour un bol de thé afin d’aspirer la force vitale de quiconque ferait l’erreur de le boire, mais en général, personne n’est dupe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es gibt sich als Tee aus und versucht jenen, die es versehentlich trinken, die Lebensenergie auszusaugen. Allerdings wird es oft durchschaut.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se hace pasar por té matcha para que algún incauto lo beba y así absorber su energía vital, pero su plan suele fracasar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Finge di essere del tè e cerca di farsi bere da qualche malcapitato per rubargli l’energia vitale, ma spesso viene scoperto.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It pretends to be tea, trying to fool people into drinking it so it can drain their life-force. Its ruse is generally unsuccessful.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "お茶の　ふりをして　間違えて飲んでしまった　相手の　生気を吸い取ろうとするが　ばれがちだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然会假装成茶企图吸取误饮者的精气，但经常会被识破。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se hace pasar por té matcha para que algún incauto lo beba y así absorber su energía vital, pero su plan suele fracasar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みんかの　ゆかしたや　たなのおくなどれいあんしょを　このむ。　にちぼつごえものを　さがして　はいかいする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "민가의 마루 밑이나 선반 구석 등 서늘하고 어두운 곳을 선호한다. 일몰 후에 먹이를 찾아 돌아다닌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜歡待在民宅的地板下或架子深處等陰涼的地方。日落後會四處徘徊尋找獵物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il aime les endroits frais et sombres, comme le dessous d’un plancher ou le fond d’une étagère. À la nuit tombée, il erre en quête de proies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hält sich gern an dunklen und kalten Orten auf wie etwa unter Fußböden oder hinter Regalen. Nach Sonnenuntergang geht es auf Beutejagd.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prefiere los lugares fríos y oscuros, como el fondo de las estanterías o bajo el suelo de las casas. Vaga en pos de presas tras el ocaso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gli piace stare in posti bui e freschi, ad esempio in fondo agli scaffali o sotto i pavimenti delle case. Dopo il tramonto vaga in cerca di prede.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It prefers cool, dark places, such as the back of a shelf or the space beneath a home’s floorboards. It wanders in search of prey after sunset.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "民家の　床下や　棚の奥など冷暗所を　好む。　日没後獲物を　探して　徘徊する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜欢待在民宅的地板下和架子深处等阴凉的地方。日落后会四处徘徊寻找猎物。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
